(1,'oficinas-en-renta-leon-guanajuato','Aldea Poliforum','León','Leon, Guanajuato','Oficinas en renta en Leon Guanajuato','','Blvd. Mariano Escobedo #2920 Ed.N Piso 5, Plaza Forum Center, Col. El Tlacuache, C.P. 37500 Leon, Gto.','','Nos encontramos en Plaza Forum Center, zona centrica de Leon Guanajuato, donde ofrecemos oficinas en renta para profesionales y empresas. A solo 1.5 km se encuentra Poliforum Leon, uno de los principales centros de convenciones de la ciudad. Nuestra ubicacion estrategica permite facil acceso a este importante punto de encuentro para negocios y eventos.','We''re located in Plaza Forum Center, a central area of León, Guanajuato, where we offer offices for rent for professionals and companies. Just 1.5 km away is Poliforum León, one of the city''s main convention centers. Our strategic location gives easy access to this key hub for business and events.','/img/sedes/leon/coworking-cafe.webp','["/img/sedes/leon/coworking-cafe.webp","/img/sedes/leon/oficina-privada.webp","/img/sedes/leon/sala-de-juntas.webp","/img/sedes/leon/lounge.webp","/img/sedes/leon/reunion.webp","/img/sedes/leon/coworking.webp","/img/sedes/leon/escritorio-privado.webp","/img/sedes/leon/oficina-equipo.webp","/img/wp/2025/07/4-7.webp","/img/sedes/leon/recepcion.webp","/img/sedes/leon/sala-teal.webp","/img/sedes/leon/area-comun.webp","/img/sedes/leon/escritorio-miembro.webp","/img/sedes/leon/pasillo-plantas.webp","/img/loc-leon.webp","/img/wp/2025/07/8-7.webp","/img/wp/2025/07/2-7.webp","/img/wp/2025/07/9-7.webp"]','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y7eeLDYp5e4',NULL,'Aldea networking leon guanajuato',NULL,'8,600','3,100','3,900','2,400',0,NULL,NULL,'{"Hospedaje": [["Hotel One Poliforum", ""], ["Courtyard Poliforum", ""]], "Restaurantes": [["Cervone", ""], ["Osteria Da Bianco", ""], ["Mr. Pampas", ""]], "Zona": [["Plaza Forum Center", ""], ["Poliforum León", ""], ["Punto Escobedo", ""]]}',NULL,NULL,'Offices for rent in León, Guanajuato - Aldea Networking','Offices for rent and coworking in León, Guanajuato at Plaza Forum Center. All-inclusive private offices, coworking and virtual address.',1,2,1,'2026-09-23 13:54:57',''),
(2,'oficinas-en-renta-san-luis-potosi','Aldea Park','San Luis Potosí','San Luis Potosi','Oficinas en renta San Luis Potosi','','Blvd. Antonio Rocha Cordero 157-D201, Fracc. Desarrollo del Pedregal, 78295 San Luis Potosí, S.L.P.','Blvd. Antonio Rocha Cordero 157-D201, Fracc. Desarrollo del Pedregal, 78295 San Luis Potosí, S.L.P.','Nos encontramos en The Park, un exclusivo complejo empresarial al sur de la ciudad, que colinda con el Parque Tangamanga y el Centro de Convenciones. Nuestras oficinas corporativas brindan espacios modernos y funcionales, disenados para impulsar la productividad de tu empresa en el corazon economico de SLP.','We''re located in The Park, an exclusive business complex in the south of the city, next to Tangamanga Park and the Convention Center. Our corporate offices provide modern, functional spaces designed to boost your company''s productivity in the economic heart of San Luis Potosí.','/img/sedes/slp/lounge.webp','["/img/sedes/slp/lounge.webp","/img/sedes/slp/oficina-privada.webp","/img/sedes/slp/recepcion.webp","/img/sedes/slp/gradas.webp","/img/sedes/slp/reunion.webp","/img/sedes/slp/cabina.webp","/img/sedes/slp/coworking-panoramica.webp","/img/sedes/slp/lounge-plantas.webp","/img/sedes/slp/comunidad.webp","/img/sedes/slp/cocina.webp","/img/sedes/slp/trabajo.webp","/img/sedes/slp/area-trabajo.webp","/img/loc-slp.webp","/img/wp/2025/05/Espacios-de-trabajo-1-7-e1748535685261.webp","/img/wp/2025/05/Coworking-Space-1-5-e1748535585769.webp","/img/wp/2025/05/Oficina-privada-1-4.webp","/img/wp/2025/05/Sala-de-juntas-4.webp"]','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v8VF3xjtFV4',NULL,'Aldea networking san luis potosi',NULL,'8,600','3,100','3,900','2,400',0,NULL,NULL,'{"Hospedaje": [["Hyatt Regency", ""], ["City Express Plus", ""]], "Restaurantes": [["Sonora Prime", ""], ["Ojo de Agua", ""], ["Sunset Rooftop", ""]], "Zona": [["The Park", ""], ["Parque Tangamanga", ""], ["Centro de Convenciones", ""]]}',NULL,NULL,'Offices for rent in San Luis Potosí - Aldea Networking','Offices for rent and coworking in San Luis Potosí at The Park. All-inclusive private offices, coworking and virtual address.',1,3,1,'2026-09-23 13:54:57',''),
(3,'oficinas-en-renta-aguascalientes','Aldea Galerías','Aguascalientes','Aguascalientes','Oficinas en renta Aguascalientes','','Av. Independencia #1861 Ed. 5, Col. Galerías Business Square, C.P. 20120, Aguascalientes','','Nos encontramos dentro de Galerias Business Square, una plaza privada al norte de la ciudad, junto al centro comercial Galerias y a solo 2 km de Altaria. Una de las zonas mas importantes de Aguascalientes por su conectividad, infraestructura y presencia de las mejores marcas, con un entorno empresarial de primer nivel.','We''re located inside Galerías Business Square, a private plaza in the north of the city, next to the Galerías mall and just 2 km from Altaria. One of the most important areas of Aguascalientes for its connectivity, infrastructure and presence of top brands, with a first-class business environment.','/img/sedes/ags/comunidad.webp','["/img/sedes/ags/comunidad.webp","/img/sedes/ags/coworking.webp","/img/sedes/ags/escritorios.webp","/img/sedes/ags/terraza.webp","/img/sedes/ags/sala-cobre.webp","/img/sedes/ags/lounge.webp","/img/sedes/ags/recepcion.webp","/img/sedes/ags/sala-geometrica.webp","/img/sedes/ags/sala-jungla.webp","/img/sedes/ags/escalera.webp","/img/sedes/ags/equipo.webp","/img/sedes/ags/area-comun.webp","/img/sedes/ags/edificio.webp","/img/loc-ags.webp","/img/wp/2025/06/Al-4-4.webp","/img/wp/2025/07/5-6-e1755036868866.webp","/img/wp/2025/06/Al-2-e1755036805656.webp","/img/wp/2025/07/1-6-e1755036822938.webp"]','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SXN9PINknDM',NULL,'Aldea networking aguascalientes',NULL,'7,400','2,700','3,400','2,400',0,NULL,NULL,'{"Hospedaje": [["Hilton Garden Inn", ""], ["Wyndham Garden", ""]], "Restaurantes": [["Mochomos", ""], ["Los Arcos", ""], ["Carajillo", ""]], "Zona": [["Galerías Business Square", ""], ["C.C. Galerías", ""], ["C.C. Altaria", ""]]}',NULL,NULL,'Offices for rent in Aguascalientes - Aldea Networking','Offices for rent and coworking in Aguascalientes at Galerías Business Square. All-inclusive private offices, coworking and virtual address.',1,4,1,'2026-09-23 13:54:57',''),
(4,'oficinas-en-renta-queretaro','Aldea Centro Sur','Querétaro','Queretaro','Oficinas en renta Queretaro - Apertura 15 de junio 2026','','Av. David Ibarra Munoz #600 Piso PH, Torre Capita Sur, Centro Sur, 76090 Queretaro','','Aldea Centro Sur se ubica en el Piso PH de la Torre Capita Sur, en el corazon de Centro Sur, una de las zonas mas dinamicas de Queretaro, junto al Hospital Angeles. Apertura prevista para el 15 de junio de 2026. Ubicacion privilegiada con facil acceso desde los principales puntos de la ciudad, rodeada de corporativos e instituciones clave.','Aldea Centro Sur is located on the PH floor of Torre Capita Sur, in the heart of Centro Sur, one of the most dynamic areas of Querétaro, next to Hospital Ángeles. Opening scheduled for June 15, 2026. A prime location with easy access from the city''s main points, surrounded by corporates and key institutions.','/img/sedes/qro/lounge.webp','["/img/sedes/qro/lounge.webp","/img/wp/2026/05/Foto-oficina-qro-1.webp","/img/sedes/qro/cocina.webp","/img/wp/2026/05/Foto-oficina-qro-2.webp","/img/sedes/qro/recepcion.webp","/img/sedes/qro/torre.webp"]','/video/aldea-centro-sur.mp4','/img/centro-sur-video.webp','Blvd. Bernardo Quintana 502 Centro Sur Queretaro',NULL,'10,800','3,100','3,900','2,400',1,NULL,NULL,'{"Hospedaje": [["Real Inn", ""], ["Fiesta Inn Centro Sur", ""]], "Restaurantes": [["Puerta la Victoria", ""], ["Paseo Querétaro", ""]], "Zona": [["Centro Sur", ""], ["Hospital Ángeles", ""], ["Torre Capita Sur", ""]]}',NULL,NULL,'Offices for rent in Querétaro - Aldea Networking','Offices for rent and coworking in Querétaro at Torre Capita Sur, Centro Sur. Private offices, coworking and virtual address — opening June 2026.',1,1,1,'2026-09-23 13:54:57','Oficina terminada en Aldea Centro Sur, con vista a Queretaro');
